<title>USA: Citicorp names exec VP/operations.</title>
<headline>Citicorp names exec VP/operations.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citicorp said Tuesday it has named Mary Alice Taylor to the newly created position of executive vice president of operations.</p>
<p>The appointment is effective in January.</p>
<p>Most recently, Taylor was senior vice president of U.S. and Canada for Federal Express Corp.</p>
